Exod 2:1 , Moses is born, and in an ark cast into the flags;
Exod 2:5 , He is found, and brought up by Pharaoh's daughter;
Exod 2:7 , who employs his mother to nurse him;
Exod 2:11 , He slays an Egyptian;
Exod 2:13 , He reproves an Hebrew;
Exod 2:15 , He flees into Midian, and marries Zipporah;
Exod 2:22 , Gershom is born;
Exod 2:23 , God respects the Israelites' cry.
